Package: excalidraw
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: TerraMasterCommunity <community@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Description: Excalidraw whiteboard for TOS
 Excalidraw is a virtual whiteboard for sketching hand-drawn
 like diagrams, flowcharts and ideas. This package bundles the
 official Excalidraw web build and serves it inside the TOS
 desktop over a local Unix socket, so drawings never leave the
 NAS.
